      "writtenOn": "2023-09-19T12:13:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did some refactoring here. Actually I think the entire API of Fdt/FdtNode can be simplified by replacing `Result\u003cOption\u003cT\u003e\u003e` with `Result\u003cT\u003e`. In the case of `Result\u003cNone\u003e`, we can simply return `FdtError::NotFound`. Users can then catch this error and choose to handle it accordingly\n\nNow this code appears verbose mostly due to this need of translating from `Result\u003cNone\u003e` to `FdtError::NotFound` in this cl and elsewhere [1].\n\nIf you\u0027d like, we can refactor the fdt API in a separate cl to reduce the unnecessary translation.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/fdt.rs;drc\u003d8025197803a4244163379e0219af4108516ede88 \u003e search FdtError::NotFound",
      "parentUuid": "24efb348_6a31ddb2",
      "range": {
